gn, not a discrepancy in the reported map, and it does not alter any coordinate or length.\n\nOMISSIONS: none - every piece of information present in the reference appears in the candidate.\n\nRATIONALE: All key information and all numerical values match exactly (ratios of 1.00 throughout), with differences confined to presentation and permissible extra detail. Equivalence 1.0. Confidence 0.95, slightly below maximum only because the candidate's added junction-mismatch warnings reference an external NOTES.md not available for review, though they do not affect the compared quantities.",
